<area shape="poly" id="edge3" href="https://www.row2k.com/results/resultspage.cfm?UID=D28F45F757DD3F3143F0D9FBF13C27B5&amp;cat=5" title="NEIRA Boys &amp; Girls Fours,BB&amp;N vs. Groton and Nobles			
Distance: 1350 Conditions: Good conditions overall with a light crosswind that was consistent throughout the day Comments: Great racing all around and thanks to Groton and Nobles for making the trip. In the boys 4th boat, Nobles paddled shortly before they crossed line. In the girls 2nd boat, Groton veered into BB&amp;N&#39;s lane before the first bridge and they clashed oars, then again after the bridge causing BB&amp;N to steer to avoid another clash. Nobles JV also made the trip and the 7th and 8th boats raced BB&amp;N on the half mile course just upstream of Eliot Bridge. Results for those races:
B7 (raced as an 8): 
Nobles
BB&amp;N
G7:
Nobles
BB&amp;N
G8:
BB&amp;N
Nobles
